# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. An import that closes unstable
# reflects nothing it can vouch for, so #4549 clears its floor and the deferred
# deliveries apply when re-shipped. Kept, the floor turns final and drops them.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceUnstableImportKeepsFloor
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an import that closes unstable keeps its drop floor, so the deliveries it deferred are dropped when re-shipped
PERTURBS: EndExport
BOUNDS: Third = TRUE, MaxWrites = 2, Reattach = FALSE

--- FIND
                  /\ fl' = IF stable THEN fl ELSE [o \in Thirds |-> 0]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an unstable import's floor is kept.
                  /\ fl' = fl
--- END
